,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":342,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:34Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-02T00:23:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T15:36:25Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T15:36:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119161","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119161.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119161.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-01T15:36:14Z"},"body":"This change switches from mikktspace.c tangent frame generation to the new comparable functionality provided by meshoptimizer via `meshopt_generateTangents`; see [documentation](https://github.com/zeux/meshoptimizer/#tangent-spaces).\r\n\r\nIt simultaneously achieves three things: fixes [common tangent artifacts](https://github.com/zeux/meshoptimizer/pull/1047) inherent to MikkTSpace, fixes incorrect tangents on seams with UV mirroring due to incorrect mikktspace.h usage (#114508) and speeds up the generation process ~6-7x (e.g. testing on a 2M triangle mesh, the tangent generation goes from ~2.5 seconds to ~330 msec).\r\n\r\nSplitting vertices with divergent tangents is correct, but may disturb shared indexing when used with blend shapes. Because of this, meshes with blend shapes skip splitting and will continue to have the same problems as shown in #114508. This could be improved in the future, as it stands this change maintains behavior here.\r\n\r\nTechnically, \"fixing common tangent artifacts\" also implies that the tangents we generate are not-exactly-MikkTSpace. Because Godot previously didn't handle UV mirroring at all and the cases that the improved weighting fixes are objectively broken in MikkTSpace, I don't think this will be a problem; but if it ever does become a problem, we can always enable the \"compatible\" option which generates the same tangents as MikkTSpace by using the same weighting.\r\n\r\nCSG code is using mikktspace directly instead of SurfaceTool. So we'd need an extra change after this to switch that over to meshopt too to be able to remove mikktspace; for now, this only replaces import path.\r\n\r\nScript-side calls to `generate_tangents` preserve the behavior of not splitting vertices with different tangent windings out of caution.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114508","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119161/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119161/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}